### 1. Register
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test1user",
  "email": "test1@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test1user",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### 3. Create Profile
POST http://localhost:8080/profiles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@mail.com",
  "bio": "Salam, bu mənim bio-mdur"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("profileId", response.body.id);
%}

### 4. Get Profile
GET http://localhost:8080/profiles/{{profileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Update Profile
PUT http://localhost:8080/profiles/{{profileId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Test User Updated",
  "email": "test@mail.com",
  "bio": "Yenilənmiş bio"
}

### 6. Submit Feedback
POST http://localhost:8080/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Bu, çox yaxşı bir servisdir!"
}

### 7. List All Feedback
GET http://localhost:8080/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Delete Profile
DELETE http://localhost:8080/profiles/{{profileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Bypass Test - Gateway-i keçib birbaşa profile-service-ə (403 gözlənilir)
GET http://localhost:8082/profiles/1

### 10. Auth olmadan qorunan endpoint-ə cəhd (401 gözlənilir)
GET http://localhost:8080/profiles/1

### 11. Actuator health yoxlamaları
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health

